        "en": "This ends the current attempt and starts a new one from the original party, progression, carry loadout, and random state. The unfinished attempt grants no rewards.",
        "zh-Hans": "将结束当前尝试，并按原入场阵容、成长、携带与随机初态开始新尝试。本次未完成的战斗不会发放奖励。"
