    {
      "key": "fm.ch1.tutorial.taunt.explanation",
      "screen": "chapter_teaching",
      "element": "body",
      "stateOrTrigger": "taunt_purpose_explanation_visible",
      "texts": {
        "en": "The Bear King's ranged attacks prefer a living Mage in range. Connect its endpoints with the Warrior: if the boss is still alive and Taunt is ready, Taunt activates automatically. During that enemy phase, the boss prefers the Warrior if the Warrior is a legal living target. Taunt expires after that phase, including a charge or rest phase.",
        "zh-Hans": "熊王的远程攻击优先瞄准法师。战士完成连线时，若熊王仍存活且嘲讽已就绪，就会自动施放，使熊王在本次敌方阶段优先攻击仍存活且在其射程内的战士。嘲讽在该阶段结束后失效；蓄力或休整也会使其到期。"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "Teaching.explanation_text_key的精确引用；用途确认独立于学习，不把展示说明当作步骤完成或Attempt建立。"
    },
