      "texts": {
        "en": "The original save did not complete. You can safely retry the same request. Diagnostic code: {errorCode}",
        "zh-Hans": "原保存未完成。你可以安全地重试同一个请求。诊断码：{errorCode}"
      },
      "parameters": [
        "errorCode"
      ],
      "severity": "error",
      "qaNotes": "仅在明确失败时允许重试。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.save_recovery.lookup_button",
      "screen": "save_recovery",
      "element": "button",
      "stateOrTrigger": "original_result_lookup_available",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Check Original Result",
        "zh-Hans": "查询原结果"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "warning",
      "qaNotes": "不是查询最近一项或页面残留。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.save_recovery.operation_summary",
      "screen": "save_recovery",
      "element": "status",
      "stateOrTrigger": "original_save_operation_identified",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Pending action: {operationName}",
        "zh-Hans": "待处理行动：{operationName}"
      },
      "parameters": [
        "operationName"
      ],
      "severity": "warning",
      "qaNotes": "operationName 由当前 L1 CandidateApplicationKind 明确映射；OperationId 仅留作内部绑定。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.save_recovery.refresh_button",
      "screen": "save_recovery",
      "element": "button",
      "stateOrTrigger": "recovery_state_can_refresh",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Refresh Recovery Status",
        "zh-Hans": "刷新处理状态"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "重新读取同一原请求的恢复状态；不得借此发起新请求。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.save_recovery.result_required",
      "screen": "save_recovery",
      "element": "inline_warning",
      "stateOrTrigger": "result_return_requested_without_verified_result",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Get the verified original save result before continuing.",
        "zh-Hans": "请先取得已核定的原保存结果。"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "warning",
      "qaNotes": "不得把未核定结果当作成功返回。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.save_recovery.retry_before_resolve",
      "screen": "save_recovery",
      "element": "inline_warning",
      "stateOrTrigger": "failed_original_request_must_be_retried",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Retry the same original request before continuing.",
        "zh-Hans": "请先重试同一个原请求，再继续处理。"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "warning",
      "qaNotes": "仅已确认失败且业务要求重试时使用；未知结果不得使用。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.save_recovery.retry_button",
      "screen": "save_recovery",
      "element": "button",
      "stateOrTrigger": "original_save_confirmed_failed",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Retry Original Save",
        "zh-Hans": "重试原保存"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "warning",
      "qaNotes": "仅明确失败时可用；复用原请求身份。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.save_recovery.return_to_original_flow",
      "screen": "save_recovery",
      "element": "inline_warning",
      "stateOrTrigger": "action_owned_by_original_flow",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Return to the original flow to continue handling this request.",
        "zh-Hans": "请返回原流程继续处理这项请求。"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "warning",
      "qaNotes": "不把路由所有权错误说成保存失败。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.save_recovery.review_end_button",
      "screen": "save_recovery",
      "element": "button",
      "stateOrTrigger": "uncommitted_request_end_can_be_reviewed",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Review Ending Request",
        "zh-Hans": "审核结束请求"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "warning",
      "qaNotes": "先进入安全结束审核；最终动作仍使用 fm.save_recovery.end_uncommitted_button。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.save_recovery.select_candidate",
      "screen": "save_recovery",
      "element": "inline_warning",
      "stateOrTrigger": "observed_candidate_not_selected",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Select an original save option from the list first.",
        "zh-Hans": "请先从列表中选择一个原保存选项。"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "warning",
      "qaNotes": "列表只包含已观察候选；选择不等于核定原结果，不得显示 CommitId。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.save_recovery.select_operation",
      "screen": "save_recovery",
      "element": "inline_warning",
      "stateOrTrigger": "original_operation_not_selected",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Select the original action to handle first.",
        "zh-Hans": "请先选择要处理的原行动。"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "warning",
      "qaNotes": "选择必须绑定实际原请求；不得按页面最近项猜测。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.save_recovery.title",
      "screen": "save_recovery",
      "element": "heading",
      "stateOrTrigger": "save_attention_required",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Save Needs Attention",
        "zh-Hans": "保存需要处理"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "warning",
      "qaNotes": "普通失败与结果未知均进入同一可恢复入口，但状态文案不同。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.save_recovery.unknown",
      "screen": "save_recovery",
      "element": "error",
      "stateOrTrigger": "original_save_result_unknown",
      "texts": {
        "en": "The original save result is not confirmed yet. We are checking it; conflicting actions are blocked in the meantime.",
        "zh-Hans": "原保存结果尚未确认。正在核定原结果，期间不能开始冲突操作。"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "blocking",
      "qaNotes": "不得把 Unknown 写成 Failed。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.save_result.confirmed",
      "screen": "save_recovery",
      "element": "status",
      "stateOrTrigger": "original_operation_confirmed_saved",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Confirmed saved: {operationName}",
        "zh-Hans": "已确认保存：{operationName}"
      },
      "parameters": [
        "operationName"
      ],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "operationName 来自 N-D01 的受控映射；不得显示 OperationId。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.save_result.notification_failed",
      "screen": "save_recovery",
      "element": "warning",
      "stateOrTrigger": "save_confirmed_but_ui_notification_failed",
      "texts": {
        "en": "The save was confirmed, but the screen notification did not finish. Reopen the page to view the saved result. Diagnostic code: {errorCode}",
        "zh-Hans": "保存已确认，但画面通知未完成。重新打开页面可查看已保存结果。诊断码：{errorCode}"
      },
      "parameters": [
        "errorCode"
      ],
      "severity": "warning",
      "qaNotes": "不得把已确认保存改写成失败，也不得提示重试原保存。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.save_result.title",
      "screen": "save_recovery",
      "element": "heading",
      "stateOrTrigger": "original_save_result_verified",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Original Save Result Confirmed",
        "zh-Hans": "原保存结果已确认"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "仅核定原请求结果后显示；未知状态不得使用。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.startup.mode.body",
      "screen": "startup_mode",
      "element": "body",
      "stateOrTrigger": "startup_mode_selection_visible",
      "texts": {
        "en": "The original Demo and Chapter One Trial use separate progress. Your original Demo data is preserved.",
        "zh-Hans": "原Demo与第一章试行使用独立进度，原Demo资料会保留。"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "两个固定资料根复用相同业务；选择入口不迁移、复制或清除已有资料。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.startup.mode.chapter_one_trial",
      "screen": "startup_mode",
      "element": "button",
