      "texts": {
        "en": "Chapter One Trial",
        "zh-Hans": "第一章试行"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "路由到已批准的第一章试行入口；已有试行资料继续原资料，无资料仍走明确建档确认。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.startup.mode.demo",
      "screen": "startup_mode",
      "element": "button",
      "stateOrTrigger": "original_demo_entry_available",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Continue Original Demo",
        "zh-Hans": "继续原Demo资料"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "路由到原Demo固定资料根；不把按钮点击当成已读取或已保存。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.startup.mode.title",
      "screen": "startup_mode",
      "element": "heading",
      "stateOrTrigger": "startup_mode_selection_visible",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Choose a Play Mode",
        "zh-Hans": "选择游玩入口"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "仅用于已批准的原Demo／第一章试行两个开发入口，不作为多账号产品界面。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.teaching.taunt.explanation_confirm",
      "screen": "chapter_teaching",
      "element": "button",
      "stateOrTrigger": "taunt_purpose_confirmation_available",
      "texts": {
        "en": "I Understand",
        "zh-Hans": "已了解用途"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "显式确认用途说明，沿独立永久教学步骤提交；全部条件满足后才正式入场。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.teaching.taunt.gift_received",
      "screen": "chapter_teaching",
      "element": "status",
