        "en": "First-entry gift received: {itemName} ×{amount}.",
        "zh-Hans": "已领取首次入场赠物：{itemName} ×{amount}。"
      },
      "parameters": [
        "amount",
        "itemName"
      ],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "仅在首次入场赠物永久提交完成后显示；itemName取本地化物品名，amount取真实赠物数量，Pending不得显示已领取。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.teaching.taunt.learn_button",
      "screen": "chapter_teaching",
      "element": "button",
      "stateOrTrigger": "taunt_learning_available",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Learn Taunt",
        "zh-Hans": "学习嘲讽"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "显式进入学习确认；满足等级或领证不自动学习。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.teaching.taunt.learn_confirm",
      "screen": "chapter_teaching",
      "element": "dialog_body",
      "stateOrTrigger": "taunt_learning_quote_ready",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Spend {itemName} ×{amount} for {characterName} to learn Taunt?",
        "zh-Hans": "确认消耗 {itemName} ×{amount}，让 {characterName} 学习嘲讽？"
      },
      "parameters": [
        "amount",
        "characterName",
        "itemName"
      ],
      "severity": "warning",
      "qaNotes": "characterName及itemName取本地化名称，amount取真实学习成本；确认沿永久提交协议，未知结果不重复扣除。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.teaching.taunt.learned",
      "screen": "chapter_teaching",
      "element": "status",
      "stateOrTrigger": "taunt_learning_permanent_commit_completed_or_already_valid",
      "texts": {
        "en": "{characterName} has learned Taunt.",
        "zh-Hans": "{characterName} 已学会嘲讽。"
      },
      "parameters": [
        "characterName"
      ],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "只显示已提交或已有合法学习事实；characterName取本地化角色名，已有学习不得再次收费。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.teaching.taunt.requires_level",
      "screen": "chapter_teaching",
      "element": "requirement",
      "stateOrTrigger": "warrior_below_taunt_learning_level",
      "texts": {
        "en": "To learn Taunt, {characterName} must reach level {requiredLevel}. Use an XP card you own or earn XP in an unlocked level.",
        "zh-Hans": "学习嘲讽需要 {characterName} 达到等级 {requiredLevel}。可使用已有经验卡，或返回已开放关卡获取经验。"
      },
      "parameters": [
        "characterName",
        "requiredLevel"
      ],
      "severity": "warning",
      "qaNotes": "characterName取本地化角色名，requiredLevel取技能学习条件；只提示正常用卡或回刷，不自动升级或消耗卡。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.teaching.taunt.title",
      "screen": "chapter_teaching",
      "element": "heading",
      "stateOrTrigger": "level16_teaching_visible",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Pre-battle Lesson: Taunt",
        "zh-Hans": "战前教学：嘲讽"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "只用于16关入场教学；学习与用途说明保持独立步骤。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.update_ready.body",
      "screen": "conditional_update_ready",
      "element": "dialog_body",
      "stateOrTrigger": "downloaded_update_reaches_natural_page_boundary",
      "texts": {
        "en": "A new version has been downloaded. Restart to apply it, or keep using the current version for now.",
        "zh-Hans": "新版本已下载。重启后应用更新，也可以稍后继续使用当前版本。"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "非当前 L1 正常链；稍后不改变当前存档／内容绑定，也不得写成新版已经启用。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.update_ready.later_button",
      "screen": "conditional_update_ready",
      "element": "button",
      "stateOrTrigger": "downloaded_update_reaches_natural_page_boundary",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Later",
        "zh-Hans": "稍后"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "非当前 L1 正常链；选择后继续当前版本。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.update_ready.restart_button",
      "screen": "conditional_update_ready",
      "element": "button",
      "stateOrTrigger": "downloaded_update_reaches_natural_page_boundary",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Restart and Update",
        "zh-Hans": "重启并更新"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "warning",
      "qaNotes": "非当前 L1 正常链；具体重启能力和平台流程须由技术方案验证。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.update_ready.title",
      "screen": "conditional_update_ready",
      "element": "dialog_title",
      "stateOrTrigger": "downloaded_update_reaches_natural_page_boundary",
      "texts": {
        "en": "Update Ready",
        "zh-Hans": "更新已准备好"
      },
      "parameters": [],
      "severity": "info",
      "qaNotes": "非当前 L1 正常链；仅在地图等自然页面边界显示，不在战斗中打断。"
    },
    {
      "key": "fm.victory.pending.title",
      "screen": "victory_pending",
      "element": "heading",
      "stateOrTrigger": "victory_saved_settlement_pending",
